ent method' => 'Payment metoade','Step %1$s of %2$s' => 'Stap %1$s fan %2$s','Change: %s' => 'Feroarje: %s','Not selected yet.' => 'Noch net selektearre.','Same as shipping address' => 'Itselde as ferstjoeradres','Same as billing address' => 'Itselde as fakturearring adres','Order summary' => 'Order gearfetting','Edit cart' => 'Cart bewurkje','Did you mean %s?' => 'Bedoelde jo %s?','Change email address to: {suggestion-value}' => 'E-postadres feroarje yn: {suggestion-value}','This is a required field.' => 'Dit is in fereaske fjild.','This is not a valid email address.' => 'Dit is gjin jildich e-mailadres.','This field does not match the related field value.' => 'Dit fjild komt net oerien mei de relatearre fjildwearde.','The CPF number "{cpf_number}" is invalid.' => 'It CPF-nûmer &quot;{cpf_number}&quot; is ûnjildich.','The CNPJ number "{cnpj_number}" is invalid.' => 'It CNPJ-nûmer &quot;{cnpj_number}&quot; is ûnjildich.','(Required)' => '(ferplicht)','Checkout Header - Desktop' => 'Checkout Header - Buroblêd','Display widgets on the checkout header for large screens. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => 'Toan widgets op &#39;e kop fan&#39; e kassa foar grutte skermen. Allinnich werjûn as jo de koptekst fan &#39;e checkout fan&#39; e plugin brûke.','Checkout Header - Mobile' => 'Checkout Header - Mobyl','Display widgets below the checkout header for mobile devices. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout header.' => 'Toan widgets ûnder de kassakoptekst foar mobile apparaten. Allinnich werjûn as jo de koptekst fan &#39;e checkout fan&#39; e plugin brûke.','Checkout Sidebar' => 'Checkout Sidebar','Display widgets on the checkout sidebar after the order summary.' => 'Toan widgets op &#39;e sydbalke fan&#39; e kassa nei de gearfetting fan &#39;e bestelling.','Checkout Order Summary' => 'Checkout Order Gearfetting','Display widgets inside the order summary at the checkout page.' => 'Toan widgets binnen de oarder gearfetting by de kassa side.','Checkout Below Place Order' => 'Checkout hjirûnder pleatse oarder','Display widgets below the place order button at the checkout page.' => 'Toan widgets ûnder de plak bestelling knop by de kassa side.','Checkout Footer' => 'Checkout Footer','Display widgets on the checkout footer. Only displayed if using the plugin\'s checkout footer.' => 'Widgets werjaan op &#39;e fuottekst fan&#39; e kassa. Allinnich werjûn as jo de fuottekst fan &#39;e checkout fan&#39; e plugin brûke.','Classic' => 'Klassyk','Boxed' => 'Boxed','Split' => 'Spjalte','Minimalist' => 'Minimalistysk','Fluid Checkout and Delivery Date plugins by CodeRockz' => 'Fluid Checkout en Delivery Date plugins troch CodeRockz','<p>We detected that you are using the plugins Delivery & Pickup Date Time for WooCommerce (free and PRO) by CodeRockz. Integration with these plugins have been moved to Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>' => '<p>Wy ûntdutsen dat jo de plugins brûke Delivery &amp; Pickup Date Time foar WooCommerce (fergees en PRO) troch CodeRockz. Yntegraasje mei dizze plugins binne ferpleatst nei Fluid Checkout PRO.</p>','Upgrade to PRO' => 'Upgrade nei PRO','Fluid Checkout database updated successfully' => 'Fluid Checkout-database mei súkses bywurke','The database changes where applied successfully.' => 'De databank feroaret wêr&#39;t mei súkses tapast.','Dismiss' => 'ôfwize','Fluid Checkout database update' => 'Fluid Checkout databank update','Some changes to the database are required. As with any update, we recommend you to <strong>take a full backup of your website before proceeding</strong>.' => 'Guon wizigingen oan de databank binne nedich. Lykas by elke fernijing, riede wy jo oan om <strong>in folsleine reservekopy fan jo webside te nimmen foardat jo trochgean</strong> .','Update database' => 'Update databank','Fluid Checkout is not compatible with the Divi Builder checkout layout' => 'Fluid Checkout is net kompatibel mei de Divi Builder kassa-yndieling','<p>Fluid Checkout needs the classic WooCommerce shortcode-based checkout form to work. When using the Divi Builder to customize the look and feel of the checkout page, the classic shortcodes are replaced with custom widgets from the Divi Builder for each part of the checkout page. These custom widgets are not compatible with Fluid Checkout.</p><p>Please edit your checkout page replacing the Divi Builder widgets with the a text widget containing the shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code>.</p>' => '<p>Fluid Checkout hat it klassike WooCommerce shortcode-basearre kassaformulier nedich om te wurkjen. By it brûken fan de Divi Builder om it uterlik en gefoel fan &#39;e kassaside oan te passen, wurde de klassike koartekoades ferfongen troch oanpaste widgets fan&#39; e Divi Builder foar elk diel fan &#39;e kassaside. Dizze oanpaste widgets binne net kompatibel mei Fluid Checkout.</p><p> Bewurkje asjebleaft jo kassaside troch de Divi Builder-widgets te ferfangen troch in tekstwidget mei de koarte koade <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> .</p>','Edit the checkout page' => 'Bewurkje de kassa side','Read the documentation.' => 'Lês de dokumintaasje.','Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature needs to be disabled when using Fluid Checkout' => 'Germanized PRO multistep checkout-funksje moat wurde útskeakele by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout','When using Fluid Checkout, the multistep feature from the Germanized PRO plugin becomes unnecessary and can cause <strong>critical errors while processing new orders</strong>. Please disable the Germanized PRO multistep checkout feature in the plugin settings.' => 'By it brûken fan Fluid Checkout, wurdt de multistep-funksje fan &#39;e germanisearre PRO-plugin net nedich en kin <strong>krityske flaters feroarsaakje by it ferwurkjen fan nije oarders</strong> . Skeakelje asjebleaft de Germanized PRO multistep checkout-funksje út yn &#39;e plugin-ynstellingen.','Go to Germanized settings' => 'Gean nei germanisearre ynstellings','Thanks for choosing Fluid Checkout!' => 'Betanke foar it kiezen fan Fluid Checkout!','You have been using the plugin for a while now. How do you like it so far? <br>Please give us a quick rating, we appreciate every bit of feedback and it encourages us to keep improving the plugin :)' => 'Jo hawwe de plugin al in skoft brûkt. Hoe fynst it oant no ta?<br> Jou ús asjebleaft in rappe wurdearring, wy wurdearje elke feedback en it stimulearret ús om de plugin te ferbetterjen :)','Rate the plugin' => 'Beoardielje de plugin','I need help!' => 'Ik haw help nedich!','Some features of WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers might not work as expected when using it with Fluid Checkout. Read <a href="%s">our documentation</a> for more information and alternative solutions.' => 'Guon funksjes fan WooCommerce Checkout Manager troch Quadlayers wurkje miskien net lykas ferwachte by it brûken fan it mei Fluid Checkout. Lês <a href="%s">ús dokumintaasje</a> foar mear ynformaasje en alternative oplossings.','Read documentation' => 'Lês dokumintaasje','Don\'t show this again' => 'Lit dit net wer sjen','Fluid Checkout PRO' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO','More design templates' => 'Mear ûntwerpsjabloanen','Optimized cart page' => 'Optimalisearre cart side','Optimized order received / thank you page' => 'Optimalisearre folchoarder ûntfongen / tankje side','Edit cart contents at checkout page' => 'Bewurkje cart ynhâld by kassa side','Account matching / user matching' => 'Account matching / brûker matching','Trust symbols on the cart and thank you pages' => 'Trust symboalen op &#39;e karre en tank siden','More positions for the coupon code on the checkout page' => 'Mear posysjes foar de coupon koade op de kassa side','International phone numbers' => 'Ynternasjonale telefoannûmers','Gift messages and packing slips' => 'Kadoberjochten en pakbonnen','Local pickup and in-store collection' => 'Lokale pickup en kolleksje yn &#39;e winkel','EU-VAT Assistant' => 'EU-BTW Assistant','I already have it – Hide this offer' => 'Ik haw it al - Ferbergje dit oanbod','Activated' => 'Aktivearre','Address book' => 'Adresboek','Select an image' => 'Selektearje in ôfbylding','Cart layout' => 'Cart yndieling','Cart optimizations' => 'Cart optimizations','Enable cart page optimizations' => 'Aktivearje cart side-optimisaasjes','Header and footer template' => 'Sjabloan foar koptekst en fuottekst','Controls whether to use the distraction free page header and footer or keep the currently active theme\'s header and footer.' => 'Kontrolearret of de kop- en fuottekst fan &#39;e pagina sûnder ôflieding brûkt wurdt of de kop- en fuottekst fan it op it stuit aktive tema te hâlden.','Distraction free header and footer' => 'Kop- en fuottekst sûnder ôflieding','Theme\'s header and footer' => 'De kop- en fuottekst fan it tema','Cart elements' => 'Cart eleminten','Make the order summary stay visible on the cart page while scrolling' => 'Meitsje de gearfetting fan &#39;e bestelling sichtber te bliuwen op&#39; e karreside by it rôljen','Coupon codes' => 'Coupon koades','Hidden' => 'Ferburgen','Before the cart items section' => 'Foardat de seksje fan karre items','Inside the cart items section' => 'Binnen de seksje fan karre items','After the cart items section' => 'Nei de karre items seksje','Before the shipping section' => 'Foardat de skipfeart seksje','After the shipping section' => 'Nei de skipfeart seksje','Before the order summary' => 'Foardat de oarder gearfetting','Inside the order summary' => 'Binnen de oarder gearfetting','Before the order totals' => 'Foardat de oarder totalen','After the order totals' => 'Nei de oarder totalen','After the order summary' => 'Nei de oarder gearfetting','Shipping' => 'Skipfeart','Select position where to display the shipping costs and calculator on the cart page.' => 'Selektearje posysje wêr&#39;t jo de ferstjoerkosten en rekkenmasine werjaan op &#39;e karre side.','Display as a cart section' => 'Werjaan as in karre seksje','Cross-sells' => 'Cross-sells','Select position where to display the cross-sells section on the cart page.' => 'Selektearje posysje wêr&#39;t de seksje fan cross-sells op &#39;e karreside werjûn wurde sil.','Before the cart actions' => 'Foardat de karre aksjes','After the cart actions' => 'Nei de karre aksjes','Layout of cross-sell items on the cart page.' => 'Opmaak fan cross-sell items op de cart side.','Optimized horizontal cross-sells layout' => 'Optimalisearre horizontale cross-sells yndieling','Theme\'s cross-sells layout' => 'Tema&#39;s cross-sell-yndieling','Number of cross-sell items to display on the cart page' => 'Oantal cross-sell-items om te werjaan op &#39;e cart-side','Add widget areas to the cart page' => 'Foegje widgetgebieten ta oan &#39;e karreside','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the cart page.' => 'Dizze widgetgebieten wurde brûkt om fertrouwensymboalen en fertrouwensbadges ta te foegjen op &#39;e karreside.','Checkout' => 'Betelje','Checkout layout' => 'Checkout yndieling','Design template' => 'Design sjabloan','Dark mode' => 'Tsjustere modus','Enable dark mode' => 'Tsjustere modus ynskeakelje','Logo image' => 'Logo ôfbylding','Choose an image to be displayed on the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Kies in ôfbylding om te werjaan op &#39;e kop fan&#39; e kassapagina. Allinnich jildt by it brûken fan de ôfliedingsfrije kop- en fuottekst.','Header background color' => 'Koptekst eftergrûnkleur','Choose a background color for the checkout page header. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Kies in eftergrûnkleur foar de koptekst fan de kassapagina. Allinnich jildt by it brûken fan de ôfliedingsfrije kop- en fuottekst.','HTML color value. ie: #f3f3f3' => 'HTML kleur wearde. ie: #f3f3f3','Page background color' => 'Side eftergrûn kleur','Choose a background color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => 'Kies in eftergrûnkleur foar de kassaside. Kleur wurdt tapast op it <em>lichem</em> elemint.','Footer background color' => 'Fuottekst eftergrûnkleur','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Kies in eftergrûnkleur foar de fuottekst fan de kassapagina. Allinnich jildt by it brûken fan de ôfliedingsfrije kop- en fuottekst.','Progress bar' => 'Progress bar','Display the checkout progress bar when using multi-step checkout layout' => 'Lit de foarútgongsbalke fan &#39;e kassa werjaan by it brûken fan multi-stap checkout-yndieling','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => 'Lit de foarútgongsbalke fan &#39;e kassa sichtber bliuwe by it rôljen','Express checkout' => 'Express checkout','Enable the express checkout section' => 'Skeakelje de seksje foar ekspresje ôfrekkenje','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => 'Toant de seksje foar ekspresje ôfrekken by it ôfrekkenjen as stipe foar betellingspoarten dizze funksje ynskeakele hawwe.','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => 'Werjaan express kassa knoppen yn ien rigel foar gruttere skermen','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => 'Negearje oanfoljende kassa fereaske fjilden by it beteljen mei in kompatible express checkout betelling gateway','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => 'Meitsje de oarder gearfetting bliuwe sichtber wylst scrollen','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => 'Kies in eftergrûnkleur foar de seksje foar gearfetting fan &#39;e bestelling.','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => 'Markearje de oarder totalen rige yn de oarder gearfetting tabel','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => 'Meast nuttich as de seksje foar gearfetting fan &#39;e bestelling gjin markearre eftergrûnkleur hat. Kin ek jilde foar de Cart, Order Untfongen en View Order siden by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout PRO.','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => 'Aksje keppeling op de oarder gearfetting by kassa.','Edit cart link' => 'Cart link bewurkje','Cart items count' => 'Cart items telle','Link to shop page' => 'Link nei winkel side','Cart items' => 'Cart items','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => 'Ferbergje cart items flaters by de kassa side','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => 'Net werjaan de cart items flaters berjocht oan de boppekant fan de kassa side. By it yntsjinjen fan it kassaformulier om de oankeap te foltôgjen, sille dizze flaterberjochten altyd werjûn wurde.','Place order' => 'Plak oarder','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => 'Definiearje de posysje om &quot;Bestelling pleatse&quot; en betingsten karfakje seksje te werjaan.','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => 'Guon opsjes binne miskien net kompatibel mei guon plugins en tema&#39;s.','Below the payment section' => 'Under de betelling seksje','Below the order summary' => 'Under de oarder gearfetting','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => 'Sawol ûnder de betelling seksje as de oarder gearfetting','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => 'Foegje widgetgebieten ta oan &#39;e kassaside','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => 'Dizze widgetgebieten wurde brûkt om fertrouwensymboalen en fertrouwenbadges ta te foegjen op &#39;e kassaside.','Display the coupon codes section title' => 'Toan de titel fan de coupon koades seksje','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => 'Selektearje posysje wêr&#39;t de coupon koades seksje op de kassa side te werjaan.','Before the checkout steps' => 'Foardat de kassa stappen','As a substep before payment methods' => 'As substap foar betelling metoaden','As a substep after payment methods' => 'As substap nei betelling metoaden','Default button style' => 'Standert knop styl','"Add" link button' => '&quot;Tafoegje&quot; keppeling knop','Checkout fields' => 'Checkout fjilden','Optional fields' => 'Opsjonele fjilden','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => 'Ferbergje opsjonele fjilden efter in keppeling knop','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'It is oan te rieden om dizze opsje ynskeakele te hâlden om it oantal iepen ynfierfjilden te ferminderjen, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">lês it ûndersyk</a> .','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => 'Ferbergje &quot;Adresrigel 2&quot; fjilden net efter in keppeling knop','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => 'Allinich oanrikkemandearre as de measte klanten it fjild &quot;Adresline 2&quot; feitlik nedich binne, of as it krúsjaal is om it juste ferstjoeradres te krijen (dus as it leverjen fan iten en oare bederflike produkten).','Billing address' => 'Billing adres','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => 'Selektearje posysje wêr&#39;t it faktueradres seksje op &#39;e kassa-side te werjaan.','As a step before shipping' => 'As stap foar it ferstjoeren','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => 'As sub-stap foar de seksje fan ferstjoeradres','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => 'As sub-stap nei it ferstjoeradres seksje','As a step after shipping' => 'As stap nei skipfeart','As a sub-step before the payment section' => 'As sub-stap foar de betelling seksje','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => 'Tsjinje faktuer- en ferstjoeradressen nei itselde (ien seksje)','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => 'It karfakje foar &quot;Itselde as ferstjoerings-/faktureadres&quot; is standert kontrolearre','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'It karfakje &quot;Itselde as ferstjoeradres&quot; sil begjinne as standert selektearre as de seksje ferstjoeradres earst wurdt werjûn.<br> It karfakje &quot;Itselde as faktueradres&quot; sil begjinne as standert selektearre as de faktueradres seksje earst werjûn wurdt.<br> It is oan te rieden om dizze opsje ynskeakele te litten om it oantal iepen ynfierfjilden by kassa signifikant te ferminderjen, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">lês it ûndersyk</a> .','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => 'Markearje it faktueradres seksje yn it kassaformulier','Shipping address' => 'Shipping adres','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => 'Markearje de seksje fan ferstjoeradres yn it kassaformulier','Shipping methods' => 'Shipping metoaden','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => 'Kies yn hokker posysje de seksje ferstjoermetoaden werjaan.','Before shipping address' => 'Foardat skipfeart adres','After shipping address' => 'Nei ferstjoering adres','Local pickup' => 'Lokale pickup','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Ferwideret seksje fan ferstjoeradres as in pleatslike ferstjoermetoade foar opheljen is selektearre.','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Ferfangt it ferstjoeradres mei de lokaasje fan it opheljenpunt as in pleatslike ferstjoermetoade foar opheljen wurdt selektearre.','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => 'Kies hokker adres te bewarjen as it ferstjoeradres foar pleatslike pickup oarders.','Save the selected pickup location' => 'Bewarje de selektearre pickup lokaasje','Save same as the billing address' => 'Bewarje itselde as it faktureadres','Do not save any shipping address' => 'Bewarje gjin ferstjoeradres','Company name field for shipping address' => 'Bedriuwsnammefjild foar ferstjoeradres','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => 'Feroarje sichtberens foar it bedriuwsnammefjild foar de seksje ferstjoeradres op it kassaformulier.','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => 'As fjild is ynsteld as &quot;opsjoneel&quot;, dat is de standert sichtberens tastân, gjin wizigings wurde tapast te litten oare plugins tapasse alle feroarings dy&#39;t se nedich hawwe.','Hidden (remove field)' => 'Ferburgen (fjild fuortsmite)','Optional' => 'Fakultatyf','Required' => 'Required','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Foegje ferstjoertelefonfjild ta oan it kassaformulier.','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => 'Kies yn hokker stap it ferstjoertelefoanfjild werjaan sil.','Contact step' => 'Kontakt stap','Billing phone' => 'Billing telefoan','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Foegje fakturearring tillefoanfjild ta oan it kassaformulier.','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => 'Kies yn hokker stap om it faktuertillefoanfjild wer te jaan.','Show country code beside the flag' => 'Lit lânkoade neist de flagge sjen','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => 'Lit in foarbyld sjen fan in jildich telefoannûmer yn telefoanfjilden','Do not change placeholders' => 'Feroarje plakhâlders net','Show if not defined' => 'Lit sjen as net definiearre','Always show' => 'Altyd sjen litte','Order notes' => 'Oantekeningen bestelle','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => 'Definiearje de sichtberens fan it fjild foar ekstra oardernotysjes.','Gift options' => 'Gift opsjes','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => 'Lit klanten in kadoberjocht en oare kado-relatearre opsjes tafoegje oan &#39;e bestelling.','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => 'Lit it kado-berjocht sjen as ûnderdiel fan &#39;e tabel foar bestellingsdetails ynstee fan in aparte seksje','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => 'Dizze opsje hat ynfloed op de side foar befêstiging fan bestelling (betankeside) en besteldetails op akkountsiden, e-mails en pakslips.','Account matching' => 'Account matching','Enable the account matching feature' => 'Aktivearje de akkount oerienkommende funksje','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => 'Assosiearje de oarders fan de gastklant mei har besteande akkount as der al in akkount bestiet mei de kontaktgegevens fan de klant.','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => 'Berjocht werjaan as der in akkount bestiet mei it opjûne e-mailadres','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => 'Ferfangt de fjilden foar oanmeitsjen fan akkounts mei in notifikaasje en opsje om yn te loggen. Yn guon konteksten is it miskien oan te rieden om dizze opsje útskeakele te litten om de privacy fan klanten te beskermjen.','Dashboard' => 'Dashboard','Integrations' => 'Yntegraasjes','License keys' => 'Lisinsje kaaien','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => 'Besykje ús webside foar mear ynformaasje oer ús plugins en tafoegings.','Order pay page' => 'Betel betelje side','Order pay' => 'Bestelle betelje','Enable order pay page optimizations' => 'Ynskeakelje oarder betelje side optimizations','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => 'Feroaret de yndieling fan oarder beteljen side foar besteande oarders yn ôfwachting fan betelling fan de klant.','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => 'Foegje widgetgebieten ta oan &#39;e oarder beteljen side','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => 'Dizze widgetgebieten wurde brûkt om fertrouwensymboalen en fertrouwenstekens ta te foegjen op &#39;e side foar bestelling beteljen.','Thank you page & order details layout' => 'Tankewol side &amp; oarder details layout','Order details optimizations' => 'Order details optimizations','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => 'Aktivearje tankje side en optimisaasjes foar besteldetails','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => 'Feroaret de yndieling fan bestellingsdetails op &#39;e tankside en akkount siden.','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => 'Oanpassingen fan bestellingsdetails ynskeakelje op e-postnotifikaasjes','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => 'Toan nije seksjes en feroarje de folchoarder fan seksjes op e-postnotifikaasjes. Stilen fan bestellingsdetails op e-postnotifikaasjes bliuwe net feroare.','Thank you page' => 'Tankewol side','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => 'Dizze opsjes beynfloedzje de tankside, ek wol bekend as siden foar ûntfongen bestelling of befêstiging fan bestelling.','Order details layout' => 'Bestelle details yndieling','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => 'Toan de bestellingsdetails mei brede yndieling op &#39;e tankside','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => 'Foegje widgetgebieten ta oan &#39;e tankside','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => 'Dizze widgetgebieten wurde brûkt om fertrouwensymboalen en fertrouwenbadges ta te foegjen op &#39;e tankside.','Order actions' => 'Bestelle aksjes','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => 'Kies yn hokker posysje de folchoarderaksjes werjûn wurde.','Inside the order overview' => 'Binnen it oarder oersjoch','After the order overview' => 'Nei de oarder oersjoch','After order sections' => 'Nei oarder seksjes','Order status' => 'Order status','Display the order status progress bar' => 'Lit de foarútgongsbalke fan &#39;e oarderstatus sjen','Choose in which position to display the section.' => 'Kies yn hokker posysje de seksje werjaan sil.','After the order overview and payment instructions' => 'Nei de oarder oersjoch en betelling ynstruksjes','Before the order items section' => 'Foardat de bestelling items seksje','Inside the order items section' => 'Binnen de seksje oarder items','After the order items section' => 'Nei de bestelling items seksje','On the sidebar' => 'Op de sydbalke','Order downloads' => 'Bestelle downloads','Gift message' => 'Gift berjocht','Tools' => 'Tools','Troubleshooting' => 'Troubleshooting','Debug options' => 'Debug opsjes','Debug mode' => 'Debug modus','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'It brûken fan debugmodus beynfloedet de prestaasjes fan &#39;e webside. Brûk dizze opsje allinich by it oplossen fan problemen.','Load unminified assets' => 'Laad unminified aktiva','Enhanced select fields' => 'Ferbettere selektearje fjilden','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => 'Fix automatysk ynzoomen op formulierfjilden','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => 'Stel <code>font-size</code> yn formulierfjilden yn op 16px','Fluid Checkout' => 'Fluid Checkout','Settings' => 'Ynstellings','Support' => 'Stypje','<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade to PRO</a> to unlock more options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%s">Upgrade nei PRO</a> om mear opsjes te ûntsluten.','(PRO)' => '(PRO)','(experimental)' => '(eksperiminteel)','Please verify your phone number.' => 'Ferifiearje asjebleaft jo telefoannûmer.','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'De Bluehost Plugin','Custom fields' => 'Oanpaste fjilden','Enable custom shipping email field' => 'Oanpaste e-postfjild foar ferstjoering ynskeakelje','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => 'As it ynskeakele is, sil it ferstjoere-e-postfjild fan &#39;e Bluehost-plugin wurde tafoege oan it kassaformulier.','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro troch BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => 'Captcha posysje','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => 'Definiearje de posysje om de captcha-seksje wer te jaan. Guon posysjes wurkje miskien net ôfhinklik fan it keazen captcha-type.','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => 'It selektearjen fan in opheljenpunt is ferplichte foardat jo trochgean.','Pickup point' => 'Pickup punt','Pickup point not selected yet.' => 'Opheljen punt noch net selektearre.','Pickup point:' => 'Opfangpunt:','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => 'Mailchimp foar WooCommerce','Subscribe checkbox' => 'Abonnearje karfakje','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => 'Oerskriuwe de posysje foar it karfakje foar abonnemint op &#39;e kassapagina en lit it altyd werjaan op&#39; e kontaktstap','Before Shipping Address' => 'Foardat Shipping Adres','(originally "%s")' => '(oarspronklik &quot;%s&quot;)','After Shipping Address' => 'Nei Shipping Adres','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => 'It selektearjen fan in sammelpunt is ferplichte by ferstjoeren mei FermoPoint.','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => 'As selekteare ynformearret typfouten yn e-post oan brûkers. (Dizze funksje is útskeakele om&#39;t Fluid Checkout de funksje biedt. Feroarings oan dizze opsje sille net fan krêft wurde)','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => 'Postkontrôle ynskeakelje: (funksje útskeakele)','Carrier:' => 'Ferfierder:','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue - WooCommerce E-postmarketing','Sign up checkbox position' => 'Oanmelde checkbox posysje','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => 'Ferpleats it karfakje foar oanmelding nei de kontaktstap','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => 'As it ynskeakele is, sil it karfakje ferpleatst wurde nei de kontaktstap ûnôfhinklik fan &#39;e werjeftelokaasje definieare yn&#39; e Sendinblue-pluginynstellingen.','Theme Betheme' => 'Tema Betheme','Checkout progress' => 'Checkout foarútgong','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kassa-stappen fan Betheme op&#39; e kassa, karre en bestelle ûntfongen siden.','Theme Fennik' => 'Tema Fennik','Breadcrumbs' => 'Broodkruimels','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Utfiere de breadcrumbs-seksje út it Fennik-tema by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout-kop- en fuottekst.','Theme Go' => 'Tema gean','My account layout' => 'Myn account yndieling','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => 'Wide yndieling ynskeakelje op &#39;Myn akkount&#39; side.','Theme Impreza' => 'Tema Impreza','Header' => 'Koptekst','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => 'Spaasje foar sidekoptekst by de kassaside (yn piksels)','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => 'Allinich fan tapassing by it brûken fan de Impreza-temakoptekst by de kassaside.','Theme Kapee' => 'Tema Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kassa-stappen út it Kapee-tema op&#39; e kassa, karre en bestelle ûntfongen siden.','Theme Porto' => 'Tema Porto','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kassa-stappen út it Porto-tema op&#39; e kassa, karre en bestelle ûntfongen siden.','Theme Pressmart' => 'Tema Pressmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kassa-stappen út it Pressmart-tema op&#39; e kassa, karre en ûntfongen siden.','Theme The Gem' => 'Tema De Gem','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kassa-stappen út The Gem-tema by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout-kop- en fuottekst.','Theme Woodmart' => 'Tema Woodmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Utfiere de seksje fan &#39;e kontrôlestappen út it Woodmart-tema by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout-kop- en fuottekst.','Checkout options' => 'Checkout opsjes','Disable the theme checkout options' => 'Skeakelje de opsjes foar ôfrekken fan tema&#39;s','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => 'De opsjes werjaan produktôfbylding, kwantiteitfjild, knop fuortsmite en keppeling nei produktside tafoege troch it tema binne standert útskeakele.','Theme Atomion' => 'Tema Atomion','Order progress' => 'Order foarútgong','Display order progress from the theme' => 'Toan oarder foarútgong fan it tema','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => 'Toan de formulierfjildlabels sichtber op &#39;e side','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => 'It is oan te rieden om dizze opsje ynskeakele te hâlden foar in bettere brûkersûnderfining.','Theme ZK Nito' => 'Tema ZK Nito','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => 'Foegje ekstra fjilden ta oan it kassaformulier','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => 'Foeget in ekstra ferstjoere-e-post en ferstjoertelefoanfjild ta oan it seksje fan ferstjoeradres.','Go to the home page' => 'Gean nei de thússide','Skip to content' => 'Gean nei ynhâld','Create an account' => 'Meitsje in akkount','Log in to your account' => 'Oanmelde by jo akkount','Already have an account?' => 'Al in akkount?','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => 'Oanmelde as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log út</a>','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => 'Jo bestelling hat in totaal ferskuldige bedrach fan %s. Gjin fierdere betelling is nedich.','Close and continue with checkout' => 'Slút en fierder mei kassa','Continue' => 'Trochgean','Parcel terminal' => 'Pakket terminal','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>Dizze widget is ferfongen troch Fluid Checkout.</p><p> By it brûken fan Fluid Checkout moat de kassaside de orizjinele WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> brûke om goed te wurkjen.</p><p> Foar mear ynformaasje, besykje de Fluid Checkout dokumintaasje.</p>','Theme The7' => 'Tema 7','Additional header sections' => 'Oanfoljende kopteksten','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => 'Utfiere ekstra koptekstseksjes as ynskeakele is yn &#39;e tema-ynstellingen.','More information' => 'Mear ynformaasje','Pick a Locker' => 'Kies in locker','Page template' => 'Sidesjabloan','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => 'Brûk de sidesjabloan `Bestellingbefêstiging` foar blokbasearre tema&#39;s','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => 'Allinnich jildt by it brûken fan in blok-basearre tema.','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'WooCommerce Stripe Gateway','Payment form' => 'Betellingsformulier','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => 'Stilen tapasse op &#39;e fjilden fan it Stripe-betellingsformulier','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => 'As it ynskeakele is, sil Fluid Checkout stilen tapasse dy&#39;t optimalisearre binne foar kompatibiliteit mei de plugin. Jo kinne dit útskeakelje as jo oanpaste stilen brûke foar de fjilden fan it Stripe-betellingsformulier.','Theme Nyture' => 'Tema Nyture','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Jou de seksje oer de kassa út fan it Nyture-tema út by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout.','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => 'Lit klanten betellingen dwaan foar oarders dy&#39;t of mei de hân oanmakke binne troch de winkelbehearder of net foltôge binne by it beteljen.','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'De plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager fan Quadlayers is net kompatibel mei Fluid Checkout','Company name field for billing address' => 'Bedriuwsnammefjild foar fakturearadres','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => 'Wizigje de sichtberens foar it fjild foar bedriuwsnamme foar it fakturearadresdiel op it kassaformulier.','Theme Bookshelf' => 'Tema Boekplank','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Jou de seksje mei stappen foar it beteljen út fan it Bookshelf-tema út by it brûken fan Fluid Checkout.','Account password' => 'Wachtwurd fan it akkount','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => 'Der wurdt in akkount oanmakke mei de ynformaasje dy&#39;t by it beteljen fan &#39;e bestelling opjûn is.','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => 'Kies de styl fan &#39;e foarútgongsbalke.','Bars' => 'Bars','Theme Ireca' => 'Tema Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'WooCommerce-side-yndieling','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => 'Forsearje brede yndieling op WooCommerce-pagina&#39;s','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => 'Dit soarget derfoar dat de ynhâldsseksje net te smel is op WooCommerce-siden, ynklusyf de siden foar kassa, winkelwein, ûntfongen bestelling, beteljen fan bestelling en akkount.','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'WooCommerce Smart Coupons','Position on checkout page' => 'Posysje op &#39;e kassaside','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => 'Kies wêr&#39;t jo de beskikbere coupons-seksje op &#39;e kassa-side werjaan wolle.','Before the progress bar' => 'Foar de foarútgongsbalke','After the progress bar' => 'Nei de foarútgongsbalke','Before coupon codes section' => 'Foarôfgeand oan de seksje koartingskoades','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => 'Formatearje tillefoannûmers neffens de regels foar elk lân.','Use precise phone number validation' => 'Brûk krekte tillefoannûmerfalidaasje','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => 'Dit is in eksperimintele funksje en wurket miskien net sa as ferwachte yn alle opstellingen. Brûk it mei foarsichtigens.','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => 'Tillefoannûmerfalidaasjetypen dy&#39;t brûkt wurde as krekte falidaasje ynskeakele is.','Mobile' => 'Mobyl','Fixed line' => 'Fêste line','Toll free' => 'Tolfrij','Or' => 'Of','Contact' => 'Kontakt','Multi step' => 'Meardere stappen','2 columns' => '2 kolommen','1 column' => '1 kolom','Before checkout steps' => 'Stappen foar it beteljen','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => 'By it brûken fan de kassa-yndieling <em>&quot;1 kolom&quot;</em> is dizze opsje altyd ynsteld op <em>&quot;Stappen foar it beteljen&quot;</em> en jildt ek foar de buroblêdwerjefte.','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => 'Posysje foar de ekstra seksje foar oarderoersjoch op mobyl.','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => 'De opsje <em>&quot;Op &#39;e sidekoptekst&quot;</em> jildt allinich by it brûken fan &#39;e koptekst sûnder ôflieding.','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => 'Op &#39;e sidekoptekst (fereasket in koptekst sûnder ôflieding)','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => 'Begjinstatus foar de útwreidbere seksje foar oarderoersjoch op mobyl.','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => 'Wy riede oan om it yn te stellen as <em>útwreide</em> foar de folgjende lannen fanwegen regeljouwingseasken: <strong>Dútslân</strong> , <strong>Eastenryk</strong> , <strong>Switserlân</strong> , <strong>Nederlân</strong> , <strong>Poalen</strong> , <strong>België</strong> en <strong>Frankryk</strong> .','Collapsed' => 'Ynstoart','Expanded' => 'Útwreide','Do not show' => 'Net sjen litte','yes' => 'Ja','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'It fjild foar ferstjoertelefoan kin twongen wurde om &quot;ferplicht&quot; te wêzen as it fakturearadresdiel nei it ferstjoeradresdiel werjûn wurdt, en it fjild foar faktureartelefoan is ynsteld as &quot;ferplicht&quot;. Dit is nedich om te soargjen dat it ferstjoeradres nei it fakturearadres kopiearre wurde kin as dy opsje oankrúst is, oars kin de klant it kassaformulier miskien net ynfolje.','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'It fjild foar fakturearringstelefoan kin twongen wurde as &quot;ferplicht&quot; as it fakturearadresdiel werjûn wurdt foar it ferstjoeradresdiel, en it ferstjoertelefoandiel ynsteld is as &quot;ferplicht&quot;. Dit is nedich om te soargjen dat it ferstjoeradres nei it fakturearadres kopiearre wurde kin as dy opsje oankrúst is, oars kin de klant it kassaformulier miskien net ynfolje.','Settings profiles' => 'Ynstellingsprofilen','Settings profile' => 'Ynstellingsprofyl','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => 'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om dizze aksje út te fieren.','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => 'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om plugins te aktivearjen.','Missing plugin.' => 'Untbrekkende plugin.','Plugin activated.' => 'Plugin aktivearre.','The following changes will be applied:' => 'De folgjende feroarings sille tapast wurde:','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Legacy options are still stored in the database to allow downgrades to previous versions if needed.' => 'Sûnt Fluid Checkout 5.0 wurde ynstellings oars bewarre. Legacy-opsjes wurde noch altyd yn &#39;e database bewarre om downgrades nei foarige ferzjes mooglik te meitsjen as it nedich is.','Your store has been running for about 2 weeks on the new settings so you could clean up legacy options stored in the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => 'Dyn winkel draait al sawat 2 wiken op de nije ynstellings, sadat jo âlde opsjes dy&#39;t yn &#39;e database opslein binne, opskjinmeitsje kinne. Tink derom dat nei it opskjinmeitsjen, as jo nei foarige ferzjes fan &#39;e plugin moatte downgrade, it standertwearden foar alle ynstellings sil brûke.','Fluid Checkout settings cleanup' => 'Opromjen fan ynstellings foar Fluid Checkout','Delete leftover options' => 'Wiskje oerbleaune opsjes','Help us improve Fluid Checkout' => 'Help ús Fluid Checkout te ferbetterjen','Share anonymous site environment reports with Fluid Checkout to get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. No customer, user, or sensitive data are included. You can choose what is shared anytime from the Tools settings.' => 'Diel anonime rapporten oer side-omjouwings mei Fluid Checkout om rapper stipe te krijen en ús te helpen kompatibiliteit te ferbetterjen en ynfloed te mjitten. Gjin klant-, brûker- of gefoelige gegevens binne opnommen. Jo kinne op elk momint kieze wat dield wurdt yn &#39;e Tools-ynstellingen.','Enable site environment reports' => 'Rapporten oer side-omjouwing ynskeakelje','Review settings' => 'Ynstellings kontrolearje','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => 'Dizze foarbyld is ferrûn. Laad de behearderside opnij om in nije foarbyld te begjinnen.','Preview expired' => 'Foarbyld ferrûn','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => 'Bestellingen kinne net pleatst wurde yn &#39;e foarbyld.','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => 'Oanmelde is net beskikber yn &#39;e foarbyld.','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => 'Akkounts kinne net oanmakke wurde yn &#39;e foarbyld.','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => 'Oanfragen nei oare siden wurde blokkearre yn &#39;e foarbyld.','Processing…' => 'Ferwurkjen…','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => 'Der gie wat mis. Besykje it nochris.','Activate plugin' => 'Plugin aktivearje','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO - It folsleine kassapakket','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => 'Alle PRO-funksjes + alle tafoegings, ien priis. Untwerpsjabloanen, optimalisearre winkelkarre- en ûntfongen bestellingspagina&#39;s, akkountmatching, en folle mear.','Optimized order pay page' => 'Optimalisearre betellingsside foar bestellingen','Express checkout buttons from supported payment methods' => 'Ekspres-betelknoppen fan stipe betelmethoden','Delayed account creation' => 'Fertrage akkount oanmeitsjen','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => 'Adres automatysk oanfolje mei Google Maps API&#39;s','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => 'Meardere opsleine adressen mei it adresboek','EU-VAT assistant' => 'EU-BTW-assistint','Hide this section' => 'Ferbergje dizze seksje','Learn more' => 'Lear mear','Get early access' => 'Krij iere tagong','Activate add-on' => 'Tafoeging aktivearje','Get more out of your checkout journey' => 'Helje mear út jo kassa-reis','Test API key' => 'Test API-kaai','Guided setup' => 'Begeliede opset','Options' => 'Opsjes','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => 'Stel de yndieling en it ûntwerp yn by de <a href="%s">kassa-opsjes</a> .','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Skeakelje gastbetelling yn en/of kontrolearje <a href="%s">de ynstellings fan klantakkounts</a> .','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => 'Skeakelje optimalisearre <a href="%1$s">winkelkarre-</a> , <a href="%2$s">tank-</a> en <a href="%3$s">bestellingsbetellingspagina</a> &#39;s yn.','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => 'Skeakelje <a href="%s">adres automatysk oanfolje yn</a> fan Google Maps.','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => 'Meardere opsleine adressen mei <a href="%s">adresboek</a> ynskeakelje.','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => 'Kontrolearje oft der <a href="%s">yntegraasjeopsjes</a> beskikber binne foar it tema of oare plugins dy&#39;t jo ynstalleare hawwe.','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. <a href="%s">Enable usage tracking</a> from the tools settings.' => 'Krij fluggere stipe en help ús kompatibiliteit te ferbetterjen en ynfloed te mjitten. <a href="%s">Skeakel gebrûksfolging yn</a> fanút de arkynstellingen.','Missing settings tab.' => 'Ynstellingsljepper ûntbrekt.','Getting started' => 'Begjinne','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>Geweldich! Dyn kassa-side rint no op Fluid Checkout.</strong> Hjir binne in pear stappen om te begjinnen:','Completed' => 'Foltôge','Preview report data' => 'Foarbyld fan rapportgegevens','Send now' => 'Stjoer no','Auto-detect' => 'Automatysk detektearje','Afrikaans' => 'Afrikaansk','Albanian' => 'Albaneesk','Amharic' => 'Amhaarsk','Arabic' => 'Arabysk','Armenian' => 'Armeensk','Azerbaijani' => 'Azerbeidzjaansk','Basque' => 'Baskysk','Belarusian' => 'Wytrussysk','Bengali' => 'Bengaalsk','Bosnian' => 'Bosnysk','Bulgarian' => 'Bulgaarsk','Burmese' => 'Birmaansk','Catalan' => 'Katalaansk','Chinese' => 'Sineesk','Chinese (Simplified)' => 'Sineesk (Ferienfâldige)','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => 'Sineesk (Hongkong)','Chinese (Traditional)' => 'Sineesk (Tradisjoneel)','Croatian' => 'Kroatysk','Czech' => 'Tsjechysk','Danish' => 'Deensk','Dutch' => 'Nederlânsk','English' => 'Ingelsk','English (Australian)' => 'Ingelsk (Australysk)','English (Great Britain)' => 'Ingelsk (Grut-Brittanje)','Estonian' => 'Estysk','Farsi' => 'Farsi','Finnish' => 'Finsk','Filipino' => 'Filipynsk','French' => 'Frânsk','French (Canadian)' => 'Frânsk (Kanadeesk)','Galician' => 'Galyskysk','Georgian' => 'Georgysk','German' => 'Dútsk','Greek' => 'Gryksk','Gujarati' => 'Gujaratysk','Hebrew' => 'Hebrieuwsk','Hindi' => 'Hindoestaansk','Hungarian' => 'Hongaarsk','Icelandic' => 'Yslânsk','Indonesian' => 'Yndonesysk','Italian' => 'Italiaansk','Japanese' => 'Japansk','Kannada' => 'Kannada','Kazakh' => 'Kazachsk','Khmer' => 'Khmer','Korean' => 'Koreaansk','Kyrgyz' => 'Kirgizysk','Lao' => 'Laotjaansk','Latvian' => 'Letsk','Lithuanian' => 'Litousk','Macedonian' => 'Masedoanysk','Malay' => 'Maleisk','Malayalam' => 'Malayalam','Marathi' => 'Maratysk','Mongolian' => 'Mongoalsk','Nepali' => 'Nepaleesk','Norwegian' => 'Noarsk','Polish' => 'Poalsk','Portuguese' => 'Portegeesk','Portuguese (Brazil)' => 'Portugeesk (Brazylje)','Portuguese (Portugal)' => 'Portugeesk (Portugal)','Punjabi' => 'Pûndjaabsk','Romanian' => 'Roemeensk','Russian' => 'Russysk','Serbian' => 'Servysk','Sinhalese' => 'Singaleesk','Slovak' => 'Slowaaksk','Slovenian' => 'Sloveensk','Spanish' => 'Spaansk','Spanish (Latin America)' => 'Spaansk (Latynsk-Amearika)','Swahili' => 'Swahily','Swedish' => 'Sweedsk','Tamil' => 'Tamyl','Telugu' => 'Telugu','Thai' => 'Taisk','Turkish' => 'Turksk','Ukrainian' => 'Oekraynsk','Urdu' => 'Urdu','Vietnamese' => 'Fietnameesk','Zulu' => 'Sûlu','Google address autocomplete' => 'Google-adres automatysk oanfolje','Google Places API version' => 'Google Places API-ferzje','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => 'Kies hokker ferzje fan &#39;e Google Places API jo brûke wolle. Wy riede oan om sa gau mooglik oer te stappen nei de nije Places API.','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => 'Wy riede oan om &quot;Places API (Nij)&quot; te brûken, om&#39;t Google de ferzje fan &quot;Places API (Legacy)&quot; fanôf 1 maart 2025 nei de status Legacy sil ferpleatse, wat betsjut dat jo dizze tsjinst net mear kinne ynskeakelje foar nije API-kaaien en dat dy ferzje fan &#39;e API úteinlik net mear beskikber sil wêze. Besteande akkounts dy&#39;t al de Legacy API brûke, kinne sûnder ûnderbrekkingen trochgean mei wurkjen.','(Recommended)' => '(Oanrikkemandearre)','Google API key' => 'Google API-kaai','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => 'Plak jo Google API-kaai en brûk de testknop om te befestigjen dat it wurket foar dizze webside. Soargje derfoar dat de kaai jildich is en tastien is foar jo domein, oars kin it adresfjild blokkearre wurde, sadat klanten har bestellingen net foltôgje kinne.','Enable Google address autocomplete' => 'Automatysk oanfoljen fan Google-adressen ynskeakelje','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Skeakelje adres automatysk oanfoljen yn mei de Google Maps API&#39;s.','Google API language' => 'Google API-taal','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => 'Dizze taal sil brûkt wurde om de adres suggestjes fan &#39;e Google Places API wer te jaan en adressen sille ek automatysk yn dizze taal ynfolle wurde.','Result types' => 'Resultattypen','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Lit leech om elk type resultaten te akseptearjen, wat meastentiids bettere oerienkommende resultaten oplevert. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Sjoch dokumintaasje foar mear details</a> .<br> Selektearje maksimaal 5 soarten adressykresultaten om werom te jaan op fjilden foar automatysk oanfoljen fan adres.<br> Besykje de dokumintaasje fan Google Maps om mear te learen oer de <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">stipe typen</a> .','Result types (Legacy API)' => 'Resultaattypen (Legacy API)','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Hokker type adressykresultaten werom te jaan by it brûken fan Places API (Legacy).<br> Besykje de dokumintaasje fan &#39;e Legacy Google Places API om mear te learen oer de <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">stipe typen</a> .','Company fields' => 'Bedriuwsfjilden','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => 'Skeakelje automatysk oanfoljen yn foar de bedriuwsnamme as beskikber','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Skeakelje automatyske oanfolling fan it bedriuwsfjild yn mei de bedriuwsnamme-ynformaasje as it weromjûn wurdt fan &#39;e Google Maps API&#39;s.','Business search' => 'Bedriuwssykjen','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => 'Sykje nei bedriuwen yn it bedriuwsfjild ynskeakelje','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => 'Skeakelje suggestje fan adressen dy&#39;t ferbûn binne mei in bedriuw yn by it typen yn it bedriuwsfjild, en foltôgje dan automatysk alle adresfjilden as in bedriuw selektearre wurdt út &#39;e suggestjes.','Company result types' => 'Soarten bedriuwsresultaten','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Selektearje maksimaal 5 soarten adressykresultaten om werom te jaan op automatysk oanfolle bedriuwsfjilden.<br> Oanrikkemandearre wearde is <code>establishment</code> , dy&#39;t de measte soarten bedriuwen omfettet.<br> Lit leech om alle soarten resultaten te akseptearjen, ynklusyf resultaten dy&#39;t net relatearre binne oan bedriuwen.<br> Besykje de dokumintaasje fan Google Maps om mear te learen oer de <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">stipe typen</a> .','Google logo' => 'Google-logo','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => 'Tekst en logo sjen litte &quot;Oandreaun troch Google&quot;','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => 'As dit oankrúst is, wurde de tekst en it logo &quot;Powered by Google&quot; ûnderoan it suggestjefak foar automatysk oanfoljen fan adressen werjûn.','Brasil API address autocomplete' => 'Brazylje API-adres automatysk foltôgje','Brasil API' => 'Brazylje API','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => 'Skeakelje automatysk oanfoljen fan adres yn Brasil API yn foar CEP-fjilden','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => 'Brûk de Brasil API om adressen op te heljen en automatysk yn te foljen mei it CEP/Postcode-fjild. Allinnich relevant foar Braziliaanske adressen.','API version' => 'API-ferzje','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => 'Kies hokker ferzje fan &#39;e Brasil API CEP-metoade jo brûke wolle.','Address book migration' => 'Migraasje fan adresboeken','WooCommerce addresses' => 'WooCommerce-adressen','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => 'Kopiearje besteande ferstjoer- en fakturearadressen fan WooCommerce nei it adresboek fan &#39;e klanten.','Enable the address book feature' => 'De adresboekfunksje ynskeakelje','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => 'Lit klanten meardere adressen opslaan en definiearje it standertadres dat brûkt wurde moat foar ferstjoering en fakturearring.','Address labels' => 'Adreslabels','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => 'Lit klanten in oanpast label tafoegje foar elk adres','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => 'Adreslabels meitsje it makliker foar klanten om ûnderskied te meitsjen tusken har bewarre adressen (bygelyks: &quot;Mem har hûs&quot;). De adreslabels binne privee foar de klanten, en wurde net werjûn of printe op &#39;e side mei bestellingsdetails of op fakturen.','Display layout' => 'Yndieling fan it skerm','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => 'Kies hoe&#39;t bewarre adressen werjûn wurde by it beteljen en yn &#39;e winkelwein.','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => 'Jildt by it beteljen en op it winkelweinke. Opsleine adressen op &#39;e akkountside brûke altyd de yndieling fan kaarten.','Address cards' => 'Adreskaarten','Address list' => 'Adreslist','Dropdown field' => 'Útklapfjild','Address search' => 'Adres sykje','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => 'Lit adressykfilter op &#39;e frontend sjen as de klant teminsten dit oantal opsleine adressen beskikber hat.','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => 'Net brûkt as de werjefte-yndieling ynsteld is op in útklapfjild.','Addresses' => 'Adressen','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => 'Skeakelje winkelkarre-optimalisaasjes yn om mear opsjes te sjen','Sticky order summary' => 'Oersjoch fan fêste bestelling','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Selektearje de posysje wêr&#39;t de seksje mei koartingskoades op &#39;e winkelweinside werjûn wurde moat. Allinnich fan tapassing as de AJAX-winkelwein ynskeakele is, en as it gebrûk fan koartingskoades ynskeakele is yn &#39;e WooCommerce-ynstellingen.','Layout of cross-sell' => 'Yndieling fan cross-sell','Cross-sells displayed' => 'Krúsferkeap werjûn','Items' => 'Artikelen','Cart page optimization' => 'Optimalisaasje fan winkelweinside','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => 'Jou jo winkelkarre deselde dúdlike, konverzje-rjochte yndieling as jo kassa.','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Pas de yndieling fan &#39;e winkelkarre oan by de kassaside foar in konsekwinte oankeapproses.','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => 'Hâld de winkelwein altyd bywurke op &#39;e eftergrûn, gjin folsleine pagina opnij laden as de hoemannichten feroarje.','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => 'Plak koartingskoades, ferstjoering en cross-sells presys dêr&#39;t se it bêste konvertearje.','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => 'Hâld de bestellingsoersjoch sichtber by it scrollen, en foegje fertrouwenssymbolen ta wêr&#39;t keapers gerêststelling nedich binne.','Columns' => 'Kolommen','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to other checkout, cart, thank you (order received), and view order pages.' => 'Algemiene stilen foar de kassa-stappen, besteloversjoch en oare seksjes. Jildt foar oare kassa-, winkelkarre-, tank- (bestelling ûntfongen)- en bestellingssides.','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => 'By it brûken fan de yndieling <em>&quot;1 kolom&quot;</em> mei it ûntwerpsjabloan <em>&quot;Split&quot;</em> , wurdt in rjochterkolom allinich werjûn as it widgetgebiet fan &#39;e sydbalke fan&#39; e side aktyf is (Sydbalke foar kassa&#39;s, sydbalke foar winkelweinen of sydbalke foar ûntfongen bestellingen). Oars bliuwt de side as ien kolom mei Split-stilen.','Split column background' => 'Split kolom eftergrûn','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => 'Kies in eftergrûnkleur foar de sekundêre kolom Split design. Lit leech om de eftergrûnkleur fan &#39;e bestelsamenvatting te brûken.','Page templates' => 'Sidesjabloanen','Checkout template' => 'Sjabloan foar kassa','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => 'Oanrikkemandearre foar minder ôfliedingen by it beteljen. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Lês it ûndersyk oer it ferlitten fan winkelkarren</a> .','Sticky progress bar' => 'Kleverige foarútgongsbalke','Progress bar style' => 'Foarútgongsbalkestyl','Order totals' => 'Bestellingtotalen','Background color' => 'Eftergrûnkleur','Action link' => 'Aksjekeppeling','Mobile order summary' => 'Oersjoch fan mobile bestellingen','Mobile initial state' => 'Mobyl begjinstatus','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => 'Skeakelje it bewurkjen fan winkelkarre-items by it beteljen yn','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => 'Lit klanten produkthoeveelheden feroarje of items direkt op &#39;e kassaside fuortsmite.','Cart item errors' => 'Fouten yn winkelkarre-items','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Allinnich fan tapassing as de koeponkoade werjûn wurdt as in aparte seksje op &#39;e kassa- of winkelkarrepagina&#39;s, en as it gebrûk fan koeponkoades ynskeakele is yn &#39;e WooCommerce-ynstellingen.','Coupon codes position' => 'Posysje fan koeponkoades','Apply coupon button' => 'Knop foar it tapasse fan in koepon','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => 'Selektearje de styl fan &#39;e knop &quot;koepon tapasse&quot;.','Address line 2' => 'Adresregel 2','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => 'Dizze ynstelling wurdt dield tusken de seksjes Betelje en Lokaal opheljen. Yn &#39;e seksje Lokaal opheljen wurdt ek bepaald oft de Ferstjoere/Ophelje-selektor yn &#39;e seksje ferstjoermetoade (foar it adres) of as in aparte seksje (nei) werjûn wurdt.','Customer accounts' => 'Klantakkounts','Guest checkout' => 'Gast-útchecken','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => 'Opsjes foar it útchecken, oanmelden en it oanmeitsjen fan in akkount foar gasten fan &#39;e ynstellingsside fan WooCommerce Accounts. Se wurde hjir beheard foar jo gemak, en dus kinne jo ferskate wearden brûke per ynstellingsprofyl.','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => 'Lit klanten sûnder akkount betelje','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Oanrikkemandearre</strong> sadat klanten net frege wurde om in akkount oan te meitsjen of yn te loggen by it beteljen, wat de konverzje tariven kin ferleegje.','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => 'As útskeakele, moatte klanten ynlogge of in akkount oanmeitsje om de oankeap te foltôgjen.','Login at checkout' => 'Oanmelde by de kassa','Enable log-in during checkout' => 'Ynlogge ynskeakelje by it beteljen','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => 'Lit in keppeling sjen foar weromkommende klanten om yn te loggen fan &#39;e kassaside.','Account creation' => 'Akkoant oanmeitsje','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => 'Lit klanten in akkount oanmeitsje by it beteljen','Customers can create an account before placing their order.' => 'Klanten kinne in akkount oanmeitsje foardat se har bestelling pleatse.','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => 'Lit klanten in akkount oanmeitsje fanút de side Myn akkount','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => 'Klanten kinne in nij akkount oanmeitsje fanút de side Myn akkount.','Username' => 'Brûkersnamme','Generate from customer\'s name' => 'Generearje út klantnamme','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Oanrikkemandearre</strong> sadat klanten net frege wurde om in brûkersnamme te kiezen by it beteljen, wat de konverzje tariven kin ferleegje.','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => 'In brûkersnamme wurdt generearre fanút de klantnamme, of fanút it e-mailadres as in namme net brûkt wurde kin.','Password' => 'Wachtwurd','Send password setup link' => 'Ferstjoere keppeling foar wachtwurdynstelling','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Oanrikkemandearre</strong> sadat klanten net frege wurde om in wachtwurd yn te stellen by it beteljen, wat de konverzje tariven kin ferleegje.','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => 'Klanten krije in e-post om har wachtwurd feilich oan te meitsjen.','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => 'Lit registrearre klanten de kassa foltôgje sûnder yn te loggen en de bestelling assosjearje mei har besteande akkount as de kontaktgegevens oerienkomme.','Existing account message' => 'Berjocht oer besteande akkount','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => 'Lit klanten in akkount oanmeitsje nei it pleatsen fan har bestelling, fanút de tankside.','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => 'Opsjes yn dizze seksje binne beskikber as gastútchecken en akkountmatching ynskeakele binne. Skeakelje beide funksjes hjirboppe yn om fertrage akkountoanmeitsjen te konfigurearjen.','Enable delayed account creation' => 'Fertrage akkountoanmeitsjen ynskeakelje','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => 'Skeakelje fertrage akkountoanmeitsjen yn as sawol gastbetelling as akkountmatching ynskeakele binne.','Section position' => 'Seksjeposysje','Before customer details section' => 'Foardat seksje klantdetails','After customer details section' => 'Nei de seksje klantgegevens','Account creation benefits' => 'Foardielen fan it oanmeitsjen fan in akkount','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => 'As jo it fjild leech litte, wurdt de standerttekst werjûn.','Inline buttons' => 'Ynline knoppen','Required fields' => 'Ferplichte fjilden','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => 'Skeakelje fjilden foar kadoberjochten yn by it beteljen','Expanded gift message' => 'Útwreide kado-berjocht','Display gift message field always expanded' => 'Fjild foar kado-berjochten werjaan altyd útwreide','Gift message in order details' => 'Kado-berjocht yn bestellingsdetails','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => 'Op it stuit binne der gjin yntegraasjes beskikber yn dizze seksje. De opsjes dy&#39;t relatearre binne oan elke plugin en tema sille hjir allinich ferskine as dy plugin of tema aktivearre is.','Phone fields' => 'Telefoanfjilden','Field visibility' => 'Sichtberens fan it fjild','Field position' => 'Fjildposysje','Phone country code & validation' => 'Lânkoade en falidaasje fan tillefoan','Country' => 'Lân','Enable country on phone fields' => 'Lân ynskeakelje op tillefoanfjilden','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => 'Filter lannen foar ferstjoering of fakturearring','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => 'Beheine de lânselektor op elk tillefoanfjild ta de lannen dy&#39;t tastien binne foar ferstjoering of fakturearring yn jo winkel.','Validation' => 'Falidaasje','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => 'Ienfâldige falidaasje ynskeakelje op basis fan lânregels','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => 'Kontrolearret oft it tillefoannûmer jildich is foar it selektearre lân, ynklusyf lânkoade en lingte.','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => 'Strangere kontrôle dat it nûmer in jildich mobyl, fêste line, of oar akseptearre type is foar it selektearre lân. Kin guon jildige nûmers ôfwize.','Validation types' => 'Falidaasjetypen','Placeholders' => 'Plakhâlders','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => 'Gjin lisinsjekaaien om op it stuit te behearjen. Lisinsjekaaien sille hjir ferskine as in lisinsearre Fluid Checkout-plugin of tafoeging aktyf is.','Default delivery type' => 'Standert leveringstype','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => 'Kies hokker leveringstype standert selektearre wurdt.','Shipping zone fields' => 'Ferstjoersônefjilden','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => 'Kies hokker fjilden werjûn wurde sille foar de filterfjilden foar lokale ophel- en ferstjoersônes. Lit leech om alle beskikbere opsjes te sjen litten.','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => 'Dizze fjilden wurde werjûn as in filter foar de lokale ôfhelferstjoermethoden. Guon fjilden kinne noch ferskine by it beteljen as se hjir net selektearre binne, as kompatibele plugins se fereaskje om goed te wurkjen.','Order shipping address' => 'Bestel ferstjoeradres','Order pay page optimization' => 'Optimalisaasje fan betellingspagina foar bestellingen','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => 'Jou net-betelle oarders deselde dúdlike, konverzje-rjochte yndieling as by it beteljen.','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => 'Optimalisearje de yndieling fan &#39;e betellingsside fan bestellingen foar bestellingen dy&#39;t noch yn betelling binne.','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Pas de betellingsûnderfining fan jo bestelling oan by jo kassa foar in konsekwinte oankeapproses.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => 'Foegje fertrouwenssymbolen en badges ta wêr&#39;t keapers gerêststelling nedich binne foardat se betelje.','Thank you page optimization' => 'Tankewol foar side-optimalisaasje','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => 'Meitsje de tankside en besteldetails dúdliker foar klanten nei&#39;t se keapje.','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => 'Optimalisearje de tankside en details fan &#39;e akkountbestelling mei in dúdliker yndieling.','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => 'Lit de foarútgong fan &#39;e bestellingsstatus, aksjes, downloads en notysjes sjen wêr&#39;t se sin meitsje.','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => 'Pas de seksjes foar bestellingsdetails oan yn e-postnotifikaasjes.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => 'Foegje fertrouwenssymbolen en badges ta wêr&#39;t keapers nei oankeap gerêststelling nedich binne.','Email notifications' => 'E-postnotifikaasjes','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => 'Skeakelje de tankside en optimalisaasjes fan besteldetails yn om mear opsjes te sjen','Use wide layout on thank you page' => 'Brûk brede yndieling op tankside','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => 'Dizze opsjes hawwe ynfloed op de tankside, it besjen fan bestellingsdetails op akkountsiden en op e-postnotifikaasjes.','Save settings' => 'Ynstellings bewarje','Docs' => 'Dokuminten','Cart' => 'Winkelwein','Thank you' => 'Dankewol','Address autocomplete' => 'Adres automatysk oanfolje','Trust badges' => 'Fertrouwensbadges','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => 'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om dizze ynstellings op te slaan.','Invalid save request.' => 'Unjildich opslachfersyk.','Your settings have been saved.' => 'Dyn ynstellings binne bewarre.','Saving...' => 'Bewarje...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => 'Ynstellings koene net bewarre wurde. Besykje it nochris.','Dismiss notice' => 'Notifikaasje ôfwize','Open settings menu' => 'Ynstellingsmenu iepenje','Close settings menu' => 'Ynstellingsmenu slute','Preview' => 'Foarbyld','Expand preview' => 'Foarbyld útwreidzje','Collapse preview' => 'Foarbyld ynklappe','Show header and footer' => 'Koptekst en fuottekst sjen litte','Hide header and footer' => 'Koptekst en fuottekst ferbergje','Page preview' => 'Foarbyld fan siden','Preview viewport' => 'Foarbyld fan viewport','Tablet' => 'Tablet','Desktop' => 'buroblêd','Preview width' => 'Foarbyldbreedte','Decrease width' => 'Breedte ferminderje','Preview width in pixels' => 'Foarbyldbreedte yn piksels','Increase width' => 'Breedte fergrutsje','Preview as' => 'Foarbyld as','Guest' => 'Gast','Logged in' => 'Oanmeld','Preview page' => 'Foarbyldside','Expand preview for a closer look' => 'Foarbyld útwreidzje foar in tichterby besjen','Available with %s.' => 'Beskikber mei %s.','Turn them on' => 'Skeakelje se oan','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => 'Optimalisaasjes foar dizze side binne útskeakele. %s om de side foar te sjen.','%s preview' => '%s foarbyld','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => 'Isolearre sesje · neat wurdt bewarre','Usage tracking' => 'Gebrûksfolging','Send non-sensitive site environment reports to help Fluid Checkout improve compatibility. Reports are not sent until enabled in the options below.' => 'Stjoer rapporten oer net-gefoelige side-omjouwings om Fluid Checkout te helpen de kompatibiliteit te ferbetterjen. Rapporten wurde net ferstjoerd oant se ynskeakele binne yn de opsjes hjirûnder.','Send usage tracking reports to Fluid Checkout' => 'Stjoer gebrûksfolgingsrapporten nei Fluid Checkout','These reports help us improve compatibility and support for your site and are sent weekly when enabled.' => 'Dizze rapporten helpe ús om de kompatibiliteit en stipe foar jo side te ferbetterjen en wurde wykliks ferstjoerd as se ynskeakele binne.','No customer, admin user, or any other sensitive data is included in the reports.' => 'Gjin klant-, behearder- of oare gefoelige gegevens wurde opnommen yn &#39;e rapporten.','Basic environment info' => 'Basis ynformaasje oer de omjouwing','WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, theme, and plugin list data. Always included when reporting is enabled. Helps us understand the environment your site is running in.' => 'WordPress, PHP, WooCommerce, tema, en pluginlistgegevens. Altyd opnommen as rapportaazje ynskeakele is. Helpt ús te begripen yn hokker omjouwing jo side rint.','Plugin settings' => 'Plugin-ynstellings','Sends Fluid Checkout plugin settings to help with support requests and helps us understand how you are using our plugins.' => 'Stjoert ynstellings foar de Fluid Checkout-plugin om te helpen mei stipeoanfragen en helpt ús te begripen hoe&#39;t jo ús plugins brûke.','Coming soon' => 'Meikoarten','Sales metrics' => 'Ferkeapmetriken','Monthly order count and total sales for one year prior to installing Fluid Checkout up to today. Helps us understand if you are making more money with our plugins installed. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => 'Moanlikse bestellingstelling en totale ferkeap foar ien jier foarôfgeand oan it ynstallearjen fan Fluid Checkout oant hjoed. Helpt ús te begripen as jo mear jild fertsjinje mei ús ynstalleare plugins. Der wurde noait klant- of brûkersgegevens ferstjoerd.','Utilities' => 'Nutsfoarsjennings','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => 'Brûk <code>TomSelect</code> útklapmenu-komponinten ynstee fan <code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => 'TomSelect is in ienfâldiger útklapmenu foar seleksje dy&#39;t minder gefoelich is foar flaters as Select2, wylst hy deselde funksjonaliteit biedt.','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => 'Stelt de lettergrutte yn formulierfjilden yn op 16px op siden dy&#39;t troch dizze plugin optimalisearre binne om te foarkommen dat der automatysk ynzoomt by ynteraksje mei formulierfjilden op lytse apparaten.','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => 'Safari en oare browsers kinne automatysk ynzoome op mobile apparaten om de tekst makliker te lêzen te meitsjen as de lettergrutte lytser is as 16px.','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => 'Skeakelje it folgjen fan skriptferwurking yn op &#39;e browserkonsole.','Unminified assets' => 'Net-minimisearre aktiva','Google Maps scripts' => 'Google Maps-skripts','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => 'Ferwiderje gjin dûbele Google Maps-skripts','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'As it ynskeakele is, wurde dûbele Google Maps-skripts NET fuorthelle, wat flaters en prestaasjeproblemen feroarsaakje kin. Brûk dizze opsje allinich by it oplossen fan problemen.','Widget areas' => 'Widget-gebieten','Last step on mobile' => 'Lêste stap op mobyl','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => 'Allinnich widgets werjaan by de lêste stap op mobyl','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => 'Lit allinich widgets foar fertrouwensbadges foar kassa sjen as jo de lêste kassastap op mobile apparaten besjogge','Standard' => 'Standert','VAT number field' => 'BTW-nûmerfjild','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => 'Foegje in fjild foar BTW-nûmer ta oan it fakturearringsformulier.','Field label' => 'Fjildlabel','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => 'Stel it label fan it BTW-nûmerfjild yn (d.w.s. BTW-nûmer). Op meartalige websiden is it better om dit fjild leech te litten en de orizjinele tekenrige te oersetten.','VAT Number' => 'BTW-nûmer','EU-VAT' => 'EU-BTW','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => 'Skeakelje it fjild BTW-nûmer yn om mear opsjes te sjen','VAT validation' => 'BTW-validaasje','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => 'Falidearje it BTW-nûmerfjild foar EU-BTW by it beteljen','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => 'Kontrolearret oft it opjûne BTW-nûmer in jildich BTW-nûmer is dat registrearre is yn &#39;e Jeropeeske VIES-database (BTW-ynformaasje-útwikselingssysteem).','Shop VAT number' => 'BTW-nûmer fan &#39;e winkel','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => 'It BTW-nûmer fan &#39;e winkel dat brûkt wurdt foar it oanfreegjen fan EU-BTW-falidaasje, en dat op fakturen printe wurdt.<br> <strong>Wy riede sterk oan om jo BTW-nûmer fan jo winkel ta te foegjen</strong> , om&#39;t oars de resultaten fan &#39;e VIES-konsultaasje miskien net jildich binne foar boekhâldkundige doelen.<br> Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> of <code>EE999999999</code> .','Reverse charge' => 'Omkearde lading','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => 'Tapasse it meganisme foar omkearde lading','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => 'Stel it belestingtaryf yn op nul en lit &quot;Omkearde betelling&quot; sjen op fakturen as it BTW-nûmer fan &#39;e klant jildich is. In oare tekst &quot;Omkearde betelling&quot; kin fereaske wêze ôfhinklik fan it lân fan &#39;e winkel.','Same country' => 'Itselde lân','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => 'Tapasse omkearde belestingmeganisme foar transaksjes yn it winkellân:','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => 'Meitsje it mooglik om it tapassen fan omkearde belestingmeganisme te brûken foar transaksjes tusken bedriuwen yn itselde lân as de winkel.','Reverse charge exceptions' => 'Útsûnderingen foar omkearde lading','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => 'Selektearje ekstra lannen om it tapassen fan it omkearde belestingmeganisme oer te slaan.','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => 'Belestingen wurde yn rekken brocht foar bestellingen út dizze lannen, sels as in jildich BTW-nûmer wurdt opjûn.','Reverse charge label on invoices' => 'Reverse charge-label op fakturen','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => 'Stel it label &quot;omkearde lading&quot; yn op &#39;e kassaside en besteldetails.','Reverse charge text on invoices' => 'Tekst foar omkearde kosten op fakturen','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => 'Stel it label &quot;omkearde lading&quot;-tekst yn op fakturen.','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => 'Belesting te beteljen op basis fan omkearde belesting','Company name' => 'Bedriuwsnamme','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => 'Bedriuwsnamme automatysk oanfolje fan BTW-nûmer','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => 'Folje de namme fan it fakturearbedriuw yn op basis fan it jildige BTW-nûmer dat troch de klant is opjûn.','Company name editing' => 'Bedriuwsnamme bewurkje','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => 'Tastean bewurkjen fan automatysk ynfolde bedriuwsnamme','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => 'As dit ynskeakele is, kinne klanten de bedriuwsnamme feroarje dy&#39;t ferbûn is mei it opjûne BTW-nûmer.','EU-VAT for digital goods' => 'EU-BTW foar digitale guod','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => 'Fan 1 jannewaris 2015 ôf binne der wizigingen oanbrocht yn &#39;e EU BTW-regeljouwing oangeande digitale guod, dy&#39;t allinnich ynfloed hawwe op B2C-transaksjes. De BTW op digitale guod moat berekkene wurde op basis fan &#39;e lokaasje fan &#39;e klant, en bewiis hjirfan moat sammele wurde (IP-adres en fakturearadres).','Tax classes for digital goods' => 'Belestingklassen foar digitale guod','Select some tax classes' => 'Selektearje guon belestingklassen','Location evidence' => 'Bewiis fan lokaasje','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => 'Sammelje bewiis fan lokaasje fan klant','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => 'Bewarret it IP-adres en falidearret it mei it fakturearadres fan &#39;e klant. Klanten moatte har fakturearadres befêstigje troch in seleksjefakje op &#39;e kassaside oan te krúsjen as it lân fan har fakturearadres en IP net oerienkomt.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Dizze opsje wurdt beheard yn Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Feroarje it yn &#39;e ynstellings fan klantakkounts</a> .','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => 'Dizze opsje wurdt beheard yn Fluid Checkout. Wizigje it ûnder Fluid Checkout &gt; Klantenakkounts.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => 'Dizze opsje wurdt beheard yn Fluid Checkout. De ferstjoerbestimming is altyd ynsteld op &quot;Standert nei ferstjoeradres klant&quot; as Fluid Checkout aktivearre is. Klanten kinne noch altyd ferskillende ferstjoer- en fakturearadressen opjaan by it beteljen.<br><br> In de <a href="%s">ynstellings foar Fluid Checkout</a> is in opsje beskikber om it standert fakturearadres yn te stellen op itselde as it ferstjoeradres.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => 'Dizze opsje wurdt beheard yn Fluid Checkout. De ferstjoerbestimming is altyd ynsteld op &quot;Standert nei ferstjoeradres klant&quot; as Fluid Checkout aktivearre is. Klanten kinne noch altyd ferskillende ferstjoer- en fakturearadressen opjaan by it beteljen.<br><br> In opsje foar it ynstellen fan it standert fakturearadres op itselde as it ferstjoeradres is beskikber by WooCommerce &gt; Ynstellings &gt; Fluid Checkout.','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => 'Dizze ynstellings binne ferpleatst nei WP Admin &gt; Fluid Checkout &gt; Ynstellings.','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => 'Dit ljepblêd WooCommerce-ynstellingen is ôfwiisd en sil fuortsmiten wurde yn Fluid Checkout 6.0.','Go to settings page' => 'Gean nei de ynstellingsside','Hide this tab permanently' => 'Ferbergje dit ljepblêd permanint','Site report preview' => 'Foarbyld fan siderapport','This is the data that would be included in the next site environment report based on your current settings.' => 'Dit binne de gegevens dy&#39;t opnommen wurde soene yn it folgjende side-omjouwingsrapport op basis fan jo hjoeddeistige ynstellings.','Loading report preview...' => 'Foarbyld fan rapport laden...','Could not load the site report preview. Try again.' => 'Koe it foarbyld fan it siderapport net lade. Besykje it opnij.','Could not send the site report. Try again.' => 'Koe it siderapport net ferstjoere. Besykje it opnij.','Site report sent successfully.' => 'Siderapport mei súkses ferstjoerd.','Enable and send now' => 'Ynskeakelje en no ferstjoere','Close' => 'Slute','A site report request is already in progress. Try again in a moment.' => 'In fersyk foar in siderapport is al oan &#39;e gong. Besykje it oer in momint nochris.','Site environment reporting is disabled.' => 'Rapportaasje oer side-omjouwing is útskeakele.','No site report data is available to send.' => 'Der binne gjin siderapportgegevens beskikber om te ferstjoeren.','This site domain cannot send environment reports (local or development domains are excluded).' => 'Dit sidedomein kin gjin omjouwingsrapporten ferstjoere (lokale of ûntwikkelingsdomeinen binne útsletten).','A site report was sent recently. Try again later.' => 'In siderapport is koartlyn ferstjoerd. Besykje it letter nochris.','The site report could not be sent. Try again later.' => 'It siderapport koe net ferstjoerd wurde. Besykje it letter nochris.','Site environment reporting is not available.' => 'Rapportaazje oer side-omjouwing is net beskikber.','No site report data is available for the selected settings.' => 'Der binne gjin siderapportgegevens beskikber foar de selektearre ynstellings.','You are not allowed to manage site reports.' => 'Jo meie gjin siderapporten beheare.','PRO feature' => 'PRO-funksje','Other plugins' => 'Oare plugins','Get only this add-on &mdash; %s' => 'Krij allinnich dizze tafoeging — %s','Install add-on' => 'Ynstallearje tafoeging','Upgrade to PRO &mdash; %s' => 'Upgrade nei PRO — %s','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Krij %2$s</a> om dizze opsjes te ûntsluten.','Add-on' => 'Tafoeging','View documentation' => 'Dokumintaasje besjen','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => 'Oanfragen fereaskje in oanmelde WordPress-brûker. Lit user_id wei om de gegevens fan &#39;e hjoeddeiske brûker te brûken, of jou user_id troch oan in oar akkount as de beller dy brûker bewurkje kin (edit_user-mooglikheid). Net-autentisearre oanfragen jouwe fc_api_forbidden werom. In ûnjildich user_id jout fc_api_user_not_found werom.','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => 'HTTP 200 mei { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } } as de handler in payload weromjout.','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => 'HTTP 200 mei { &quot;success&quot;: true } as der gjin payload is (bygelyks DELETE).','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => 'Flaters jouwe WordPress REST-flater JSON werom fan WP_Error (koade, berjocht, data.status). Wire-koades brûke it foarheaksel fc_api_*.','Forbidden access.' => 'Ferbeane tagong.','Target user was not found.' => 'Doelbrûker waard net fûn.','This feature is not available.' => 'Dizze funksje is net beskikber.','A required address field is missing.' => 'In ferplicht adresfjild ûntbrekt.','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => 'Postkoade of postkoade is ûnjildich.','Phone number is invalid.' => 'Telefoannûmer is ûnjildich.','State or county is invalid.' => 'Steat of provinsje is ûnjildich.','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => 'Lân is ûnjildich of hat gjin adresfjilden.','The request could not be processed.' => 'It fersyk koe net ferwurke wurde.','Back to previous step' => 'Werom nei foarige stap','Skip to settings' => 'Gean nei ynstellings','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => 'Begjin opnij en gean werom nei de earste stap foar begeliede ynstallaasje','Start over' => 'Begjin opnij','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => 'Foltôgje asjebleaft alle substappen foardat jo trochgean.','Expand' => 'Útwreidzje','Collapse' => 'Ynstoarten','Skip' => 'Oerslaan','Mark as complete' => 'Markearje as foltôge','Mark as incomplete' => 'Markearje as ûnfolslein','View full-size image: %s' => 'Ofbylding op folsleine grutte besjen: %s','Full-size setup guide image' => 'Ofbylding fan ynstallaasjegids op folsleine grutte','Close image' => 'Ofbylding slute','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => 'Begeliede ynstallaasje fan floeistofkontrôle','Welcome' => 'Wolkom','Explore your checkout' => 'Ferkenne jo kassa','All set' => 'Alles klear','You do not have permission to access this page.' => 'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om tagong te krijen ta dizze side.','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => 'Gean nei stap %1$d: %2$s','This guided setup helps you get familiar with Fluid Checkout. The steps below are placeholders for now.' => 'Dizze begeliede opset helpt jo fertroud te wurden mei Fluid Checkout. De stappen hjirûnder binne foarearst tydlike oanwizings.','Continue to the next step when you are ready.' => 'Gean troch nei de folgjende stap as jo klear binne.','Open your store checkout to see Fluid Checkout in action.' => 'Iepenje jo winkelkassa om Fluid Checkout yn aksje te sjen.','View checkout page' => 'Besjoch de kassaside','You can return to Fluid Checkout settings to continue configuring your store.' => 'Jo kinne weromgean nei de ynstellings fan Fluid Checkout om troch te gean mei it konfigurearjen fan jo winkel.','Review checkout and cart settings' => 'Kontrolearje de ynstellings foar kassa en winkelwein','Explore add-ons from the dashboard' => 'Ferkenne tafoegings fanút it dashboard','Finish & go to settings' => 'Foltôgje en gean nei ynstellings','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Update de sichtberensopsje fan it fjild foar fakturearringstelefoan fan &#39;e âlde wearde om oerien te kommen mei WooCommerce-konvinsjes.','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Update de sichtberensopsje fan it fjild foar ferstjoertelefoan fan &#39;e âlde wearde om oerien te kommen mei WooCommerce-konvinsjes.','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => 'Kopiearje de eftergrûnkleurynstelling fan &#39;e bestellingsoersjoch nei de nije opsje foar eftergrûnkleur fan &#39;e sekundêre kolom fan it Split-ûntwerp.','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => 'De ferbettere funksje foar it selektearjen fan fjilden is altyd útskeakele by it brûken fan de Biteship-plugin.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'De posysje fan it pleatsen fan in bestelling is altyd ynsteld op &quot;Under it besteloversjoch&quot; by it brûken fan &#39;e Dútske Markt. Dy plugin fereasket dat de knop &quot;pleats in bestelling&quot; en juridyske seleksjefakjes ûnder it besteloversjoch werjûn wurde.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'De posysje fan &#39;e bestelling pleatse is altyd ynsteld op &quot;Under it besteloversjoch&quot; by it brûken fan Germanized foar WooCommerce. Dy plugin fereasket dat de knop &#39;bestelling pleatse&#39; en juridyske seleksjefakjes ûnder it besteloversjoch werjûn wurde.','Edit pickup locations' => 'Ophelplakken bewurkje','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => 'Brûk it lokale ophellabel fanút WooCommerce-ynstellingen','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => 'As it ynskeakele is, komt it label foar de ophelopsje by it beteljen oerien mei de titel fan &#39;e ynstellings foar WooCommerce-ophellokaasje. As it útskeakele is, brûkt it label de oersetbere tekst &quot;Lokale ophel&quot; fan Fluid Checkout.','Button label for applying coupon codesApply' => 'Tapasse','Checkout step titleContact' => 'Kontakt','Checkout step titleShipping' => 'Skipfeart','Checkout step titleBilling' => 'Billing','Checkout step titlePayment' => 'Betelling','Checkout substep change link labelChange' => 'Feroaring','Checkout substep save link labelSave changes' => 'Bewarje feroarings','Substep review textNone.' => 'Gjin.','Substep review field format%1$s' => '%1$s','Substep review field format: with label%2$s: %1$s' => '%2$s: %1$s','Image uploader.No image selected.' => 'Gjin ôfbylding selektearre.','Settings sectionCart' => 'Cart','Settings sectionOrder pay' => 'Betel betelje','Settings sectionThank you' => 'Dankewol','Settings section titleIntegrations' => 'Yntegraasjes','Settings section titleLicense keys' => 'Lisinsje kaaien','Captcha positionBefore place order section' => 'Foardat plak oarder seksje','Captcha positionBefore place order button' => 'Foardat plak bestelling knop','No shipping method chosen label for the order summary--' => '--','Close button aria-labelClose' => 'Slute','Log in link label at checkout contact stepLog in' => 'Oanmelde','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue below' => 'Of trochgean hjirûnder','Log in separator label at for when guest checkout is disabledOr continue as a guest' => 'Of trochgean as gast','Clear image selection on admin pages.Remove image' => 'Ofbylding fuortsmite','shipping packagesShipping %d' => 'Ferstjoering %d','shipping packagesShipping' => 'Ferstjoering','Used as fallback for "Proceed to next step" button labelnext step' => 'folgjende stap','Substep review checkbox valueYes' => 'Ja','Substep review checkbox line%1$s: %2$s' => '%1$s: %2$s','Dummy customer first name in the admin previewJohn' => 'Jan','Dummy customer last name in the admin previewDoe' => 'Hinde','Dummy customer company in the admin previewExample Company' => 'Foarbyldbedriuw','Dummy customer street address in the admin preview123 Main Street' => '123 Haadstrjitte','Dummy customer city in the admin previewAnytown' => 'Elke stêd','Dummy order notes in the admin previewPlease leave the package at the front door.' => 'Lit it pakket asjebleaft by de foardoar achter.','Dummy product name in the admin previewBeanie' => 'Muts','Dummy product name in the admin previewCap' => 'Kap','Dummy product name in the admin previewT-Shirt' => 'T-shirt','Dummy order update in the admin previewWe received your order and will send you an update when it ships.' => 'Wy hawwe jo bestelling ûntfongen en sille jo in update stjoere as it ferstjoerd wurdt.','Dummy download in the admin previewUser guide' => 'Brûkersgids','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (New)' => 'Plakken API (Nij)','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (Legacy)' => 'Plakken API (Legacy)','Brasil API versionsVersion 1' => 'Ferzje 1','Brasil API versionsVersion 2' => 'Ferzje 2','Delayed account creation benefits placeholder text✔ Checkout faster next time
